            "inlines": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "As the class intervals become narrower, the histogram steps become finer. The polygon joins the midpoints of the tops of adjacent bars, so its segments follow the histogram more closely. With plentiful data, both shapes approach a common smooth distribution curve.",
